<!--
  MOCK DATA - Object Importer control file (import.xml)

  Everything must sit inside one <import> ... </import> block.
  Every <node> is one action on one object:
    type   = what kind of object (folder, document, ...)
    action = what to do with it (create, update, sync, addversion, delete)

  Order matters: folders are created first so the documents have a place to go.
  Dates are written as YYYYMMDD (for example 20260925 = 25-09-2026).
-->
